<title>UK: Eurofima sets 100 million rand bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 100 million rand bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.50     MATURITY    07.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500</p>
<p>SALE LIMIT US/UK/SW/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
